OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FScattered showers will be
OL,6,Finterspersed with the occasional
OL,7,Fbright spell at first. Cloud will
OL,8,Fspread across Orkney during the
OL,9,Fmorning and Shetland later in the
OL,10,Fafternoon. Showers will become
OL,11,Ffrequent across Orkney towards the
OL,12,Fevening.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FThe evening will be cloudy
OL,15,Fwith scattered showers across
OL,16,FShetland, frequent over Orkney.
OL,17,FFrequent showers spread to Shetland
OL,18,Ffor a time around midnight. Becoming
OL,19,Fmainly dry towards morning.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
