OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FA cloudy but mostly dry
OL,6,Fstart becoming showery over Shetland
OL,7,Ffor a time. Strong winds and outbreaks
OL,8,Fof locally heavy rain spread northeast
OL,9,Fduring the afternoon.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FBright
OL,12,Fspells and frequent showers becoming
OL,13,Fwindy later Sunday. Frequent showers
OL,14,Fclear and the wind eases down Monday.
OL,15,FStrong winds, showery rain return from
OL,16,FMonday night and continue through
OL,17,FTuesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
